<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Persona Black Prince Sword -->
  <OE_Trophy_BrokenSword_P.label>人格黑王子剑</OE_Trophy_BrokenSword_P.label>
  <!-- EN: According to legend, an unknown persona sword fell from the skies and its first owner became Black Prince Lelouch, who started Obsidia's Last War. But before the end of this war, the sword broke at the time of Lelouch's death, and to this day only a fragment of the sword remains.\n\nThis is a rare trophy weapon.\n\nFeature: improves social impact and able to deal a random additional type of damage. -->
  <OE_Trophy_BrokenSword_P.description>据传说，一把未知的人格剑从天而降，它的第一位持有者成为了黑王子鲁路修，他发起了黑曜石的最后战争。但在战争结束前，这把剑在鲁路修死亡时断裂，至今只剩下剑的一部分。\n\n这是一种稀有的战利品武器。\n\n特性：提高社交影响力，能够造成随机的额外类型伤害。</OE_Trophy_BrokenSword_P.description>
  <!-- EN: handle -->
  <OE_Trophy_BrokenSword_P.tools.handle.label>握把</OE_Trophy_BrokenSword_P.tools.handle.label>
  <!-- EN: point -->
  <OE_Trophy_BrokenSword_P.tools.point.label>剑尖</OE_Trophy_BrokenSword_P.tools.point.label>
  <!-- EN: edge -->
  <OE_Trophy_BrokenSword_P.tools.edge.label>剑刃</OE_Trophy_BrokenSword_P.tools.edge.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Persona Lloyd's Shovel -->
  <OE_Trophy_Shovel_P.label>人格劳埃德的铲子</OE_Trophy_Shovel_P.label>
  <!-- EN: The favorite persona shovel used by the greatest Lloyd Frontera, who received his title of The Greatest Estate Developer known throughout the Obsidia Empire.\n\nThis is a rare trophy weapon.\n\nFeature: a built-in module that improves mining skills. -->
  <OE_Trophy_Shovel_P.description>最伟大的劳埃德·弗龙特拉所使用的最喜爱的人格铲子，他在整个黑曜石帝国被誉为最伟大的地产开发商。\n\n这是一种稀有的战利品武器。\n\n特性：内置模块，提高挖掘技能。</OE_Trophy_Shovel_P.description>
  <!-- EN: shovel -->
  <OE_Trophy_Shovel_P.tools.shovel.label>铲子</OE_Trophy_Shovel_P.tools.shovel.label>
  
</LanguageData>